            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. All sales areas shall have at least one (1) Regular person assigned as an “opener” and at least one (1) Regular person assigned as a “closer.” These shifts shall be offered in a fair and equitable manner",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                315,
                1423,
                403
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    406.0,
                    315.0
                ],
                [
                    1423.0,
                    315.0
                ],
                [
                    1423.0,
                    403.0
                ],
                [
                    406.0,
                    403.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. During the Christmas Season when more than one “opener” and/or “closer” per sales area is needed, no less than fifty (50) percent of these opening and/or closing schedules shall be filled by Christmas Seasonal Employees. Assignment of Regular employees to these opening or closing schedules during the Christmas Season shall be done in a fair and equitable manner",
            "block_bbox": [
                406,
                428,
                1432,
                547
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
