        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. For all Regular Employees work performed in excess of five (5) hours from the beginning of the workday without a lunch period, unless the employee's workday is completed in six (6) hours or less. All sales transactions are to be completed at the time the person is due to go to lunch or at the scheduled quitting time, without the payment of overtime as provided above.",
